        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze, aca aransobanurira ati: Kirya gikoko ca kane, ni ubwami bwa kane buzohaguruka kuganza isi. Buzoba butandukanye n’ubundi bwami bwabwitangiye imbere kandi buzotabagura isi yose, buyisiribange kandi buyijanjagure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahembe yaco cumi, ni abami cumi bazotegeka ubwo bwami. Hanyuma uwundi mwami atandukanye n’abo cumi azokwima kandi azokuraho abami batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mwami azovuga ibintu bibi ku Mana Musumbavyose, kandi azogirira nabi cane abera b’Imana, agerageze guhindura amabwirizwa y’Imana n’imisi mikuru yashinzwe. Abera b’Imana bazoshirwa mu maboko yiwe ikiringo kingana n’igihe, n’ibihe bibiri, hamwe n’igice c’igihe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
