          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, mu nyuma ubucamanza buzomucira urubanza, n’ubushobozi bwose abwakwe, hanyuma arandurwe ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ho ukuganza, ubushobozi, no gushirwa hejuru kwose kw’ubwami buri musi y’izuba buzohabwa abera b’Iyisumbavyose. Ubwami bwiwe buzokwamaho ibihe bidashira, kandi abatware bose bazomutazira bamwumvire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
