              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ni ho ukwerekwa kwagarukiye. Jewe, Daniyeli, nagize ubwoba bwinshi kubera ivyiyumviro vyinshi bivuye ku vyo neretswe, mu maso hanje hariraburanirwa, ariko ndabigumiza mu mutima wanje.”",
          "type": "text",
